{"posts":[{"id":"diamond_p10_226","t":"Went through all pages of Diamond thread. Nice setup. My next job is to find this setup.","a":"Shantala","d":"","n":"#226","p":10,"im":[],"m":226},{"id":"diamond_p10_227","t":"Happy New Year everyone! It has been great to see so many of you busy still practising and learning over the holidays:) I'm here now with my homework after spending the holidays reading through this whole thread.. first one on GBPNZD daily chart...","a":"moogroo","d":"","n":"#227","p":10,"im":["b785dd199b747a1a8a9c89b586751b5524c59c7b"],"m":227},{"id":"diamond_p10_228","t":"Away\n\nA M5 DM on NZD CHF. The origin was in April 2015 so I couldn't get better than H1 history but it really aligns to the pip.... fascinating","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#228","p":10,"im":["3de04062233dc190f3bd78e3d534790bf0eb789c","e4bbf5a1d7278b4ceb6eaad6325bfb15693ab525"],"m":228},{"id":"diamond_p10_229","t":"here is my thinking about DM and target.. correct me seniors if i am wrong","a":"Mukhcin","d":"","n":"#229","p":10,"im":["a89cc5c19047ff30a542baa2cbeefdda951a5454"],"m":229},{"id":"diamond_p10_230","t":"this was reply to GGJJ","a":"Mukhcin","d":"","n":"#230","p":10,"im":[],"m":230},{"id":"diamond_p10_231","t":"Hey RTM. some diamonds from me) please correct if i am wrong...","a":"Mukhcin","d":"","n":"#231","p":10,"im":["fe0c3e26f109946923a13748dd126a3343a1016b"],"m":231},{"id":"diamond_p10_232","t":"QM & DM in one place???","a":"Mukhcin","d":"","n":"#232","p":10,"im":["03457669c22b3d442dd6ac42b5d23b2670efe6b1"],"m":232},{"id":"diamond_p10_233","t":"You'll need to describe not just the PA, but also where it's occurring.\n\nConfirmed PA trades must be taken at targets for price.\n\nYou should also mark the confirming PA: The engulf of a flag limit which hasn't reached its target","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#233","p":10,"im":[],"m":233},{"id":"diamond_p10_234","t":"Hi Mukhcin,\n\nThat's hard to tell if those are diamonds or not. For sure we can see the patterns in your charts, but that's not enough to make a diamond, we have to know what the diamond is a reaction to, and what FL has been engulfed, these are the most important things, and I don't see them in your charts. You've to go beyond the patterns Good luck","a":"HCDE","d":"","n":"#234","p":10,"im":[],"m":234},{"id":"diamond_p10_235","t":"My first three Diamonds HW","a":"traderscape","d":"","n":"#235","p":10,"im":["2092276ae989cf0d2783ff9a000712e6a3513151","06be63b2b16688f4ac02221954ddd85141921da5","b1e3ebd629486d86326b11a4795673660e407a79"],"m":235}],"images":[{"k":"b785dd199b747a1a8a9c89b586751b5524c59c7b","t":"assets/thumbs/b785dd199b747a1a8a9c89b586751b5524c59c7b.webp","f":"assets/images/b785dd199b747a1a8a9c89b586751b5524c59c7b.png","w":1800,"h":914,"b":437077,"o":"b785dd199b747a1a8a9c89b586751b5524c59c7b.png","p":10,"pid":"diamond_p10_227"},{"k":"3de04062233dc190f3bd78e3d534790bf0eb789c","t":"assets/thumbs/3de04062233dc190f3bd78e3d534790bf0eb789c.webp","f":"assets/images/3de04062233dc190f3bd78e3d534790bf0eb789c.png","w":1800,"h":722,"b":162403,"o":"3de04062233dc190f3bd78e3d534790bf0eb789c.png","p":10,"pid":"diamond_p10_228"},{"k":"e4bbf5a1d7278b4ceb6eaad6325bfb15693ab525","t":"assets/thumbs/e4bbf5a1d7278b4ceb6eaad6325bfb15693ab525.webp","f":"assets/images/e4bbf5a1d7278b4ceb6eaad6325bfb15693ab525.png","w":1800,"h":718,"b":384312,"o":"e4bbf5a1d7278b4ceb6eaad6325bfb15693ab525.png","p":10,"pid":"diamond_p10_228"},{"k":"a89cc5c19047ff30a542baa2cbeefdda951a5454","t":"assets/thumbs/a89cc5c19047ff30a542baa2cbeefdda951a5454.webp","f":"assets/images/a89cc5c19047ff30a542baa2cbeefdda951a5454.png","w":1500,"h":867,"b":118649,"o":"a89cc5c19047ff30a542baa2cbeefdda951a5454.png","p":10,"pid":"diamond_p10_229"},{"k":"fe0c3e26f109946923a13748dd126a3343a1016b","t":"assets/thumbs/fe0c3e26f109946923a13748dd126a3343a1016b.webp","f":"assets/images/fe0c3e26f109946923a13748dd126a3343a1016b.png","w":1366,"h":592,"b":52259,"o":"fe0c3e26f109946923a13748dd126a3343a1016b.png","p":10,"pid":"diamond_p10_231"},{"